        "note": "Fugue/Tau691.lean (Lean v4.34.1) proves the case k = 12. Its pieces (integrality of Δ via the pentagonal series, the identity E₄³ − E₁₂ = (432000/691)Δ, clearing the denominator) are ported to Lean v4.35.0 and the module system and generalised to E₄^(a+3)·E₆^b − E_k = c·Δ·E₄^a·E₆^b for every (a, b) with M_{4a+6b} one-dimensional.",
