      {
        "identifier": "https://github.com/TauCetiProject/TauCeti/tree/83769e442d55cda9d85b3927a93b286831c595ff",
        "note": "Not used. At this commit (10 November 2026) TauCeti has the identity E₄³ − 720Δ = E₁₂ − (65520/691)Δ (ThetaSeries/Leech.lean) and the multiplicativity of τ, but a text search of its modular-forms directory for the six moduli found no congruence between a cusp form and an Eisenstein series. The same search of Mathlib v4.35.0 found none. The five congruences for k = 16 to 26 were not found formalised anywhere searched.",
